&lt;p&gt;The ASF was formed from a group of developers of the Apache HTTP Server. The ASF is a 501(c)(3) charitable organization run almost exclusively by volunteers who oversee hundreds of projects. Our sponsors enable us to maintain the infrastructure needed to support them.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>OpenAPI Specification</title><link>https://currysinhk.github.io/blog/posts/tech-things/swagger/open-api/</link><pubDate>Wed, 24 Apr 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://currysinhk.github.io/blog/posts/tech-things/swagger/open-api/</guid><description>&lt;h2 class="relative group"&gt;Terminology
